么？所以齐琳就毫不犹豫的接受了这份礼物，将兽皮做成了简单的衣物，一个抹胸，一条超短裙，两个护腕，利用草藤做了一双草鞋，垫上剩下的狼皮，这样就成了一个女生版的泰山了。她不会辜负雪狼对她的信任，所以，她会尽快让自己熟悉这个陌生的环境。“嗷呜~~”雪狼走到齐琳的身边，蹭了蹭，宝石蓝的眸子尽是温柔“小白，今天大家都差不多吃饱喝足了吧。”齐琳看着正在休息的狼群，今天她们出来猎食，洞里的食物也不多了，该带一些回去了，而且已经深秋，野果子也跟真成熟起来，她也刚好可以摘一些回去。齐琳收拾好摘来的野果子，对着狼群喊了一声“各位，我们回··呃··。”“嗷呜~~”齐琳的话还没有说完，就被一股强烈的杀气打断，狼群也被这股杀气熏染，全部都以齐琳为中心围成一个圈，警惕的看着周围。原本轻松的氛围一下子紧张了不少。齐琳知道因为冬天要来，食物都变得短缺，所以经常会出现狼群抢夺食物的场景。不过齐琳每次出去寻找食物，都会做出紧密的规划，尽量避开其他的狼群，今天她特地带着狼群走到了丛林偏北部，这边气温较低，一般情况下，是不会有其他狼群的，虽然食物会比较少，却也足够她们一个狼群了。但是没想到会在这里遇到其他的狼群。齐琳将果子用往日准备的兽皮装好，往身后一系便跳上了雪狼的后背。“阿莫，你带着小满小月它们先带着食物回去。初一十五，你们几个跟我和小白来。”听到齐琳的吩咐，狼群有条不紊的执行着命令，狼群分成两队，一对朝着丛林的东方跑，一对跟着齐琳往反方向跑。“小白，待会儿遇上对手的话，千万不要恋战，我们只是引开其他狼群，让小满他们顺利的回去而已，知道了吗？”齐琳在小白的耳边再一次认真的吩咐道，却发现小白的速度慢了下来，最后直接停下，齐琳不解“小白？”其他的狼也跟着小白一起停下，却也毫不放松的盯着前方，但是就是不再上前半步。齐琳奇怪的看了看狼群，再看看四周，难道说前面有什么更危险的东西存在吗？齐琳不敢擅自跳下小白的背，只好静静的观察着四周。气氛和刚才一样压抑，还可以隐约听见狼群的嚎叫，那是正在战斗的嚎叫，难道说是狼群之间的战斗？可是，这北边的狼群少之又少，几乎都到了南边避寒寻找食物。齐琳竖起耳朵仔细听着前方的动静，眼睛也仔细的观察着自己狼群的动静，她发现除了小白之外，其他的狼都表现得很不安。齐琳抓紧小白的颈毛，直觉告诉她，前方正在进行着一场厮杀，她甚至可以闻到空气中的血腥味了。虽然和狼群生活半年之久，但是齐琳只是教狼群如何应战，并没有亲自参战，现在却遇到了，难免有些发抖。情不自禁的抓紧小白，嘴唇泛白的盯着前方。小白似乎感觉到齐琳的恐惧，侧头冲着齐琳眨了眨眼睛。忽然感觉到有什么冲过来，一下子跳开几米，死死地盯着正在发出**的草丛，其他的狼也都一样保持高度警惕状态，只要那东西冲出来，就一口撕碎。齐琳也被吓了一跳，双脚紧紧的加紧小白，双眸瞪得圆圆的。“嗖嗖嗖”声音越来越近，但是很乱，倒像是被什么追赶。“啊”“嗷呜”呃···齐琳只觉得全身的细胞都活起来了，这不是紧张，而是兴奋。她刚刚听到了人的叫声，还有狼的呜咽声，虽然不知道究竟发生了什么事，但是齐琳保证，她的的确确是听见了人类的声音。而且这个人就在不远处，应该就要接近他们了。齐琳一下子跳下小白，激动的向前走了几步，忽然又停下来，转身对着小白，开口道“小白，你们先躲起来，没有得到我的指示，不要出来好不好？”小白歪头看着齐琳，虽然不知道齐琳打算做什么，但是还是听话的隐在了草丛中。齐琳感激的点点头，将视线移到了那个高高的草丛中，抬起脚想要走过去，却发现脚像是灌了铅。好重，她已经半年没有看见过人类了，也几乎半年没有和人交流，每天都对着一群狼说话，或者自言自语，现在忽然感觉到了人类的接近。齐琳的内心开始激动，这是见到同伴的兴奋，但是她又害怕，害怕见到历史上曾经出现的某个将军人物，从此被卷入自己一直不喜欢的生活。“扑哧”“吧嗒吧嗒”几只鸟快速的从大树上飞过，使得大树一阵摇晃，噼里啪啦落下数滴雨，打在齐琳的身上，也让她清醒了一点。齐琳这才回过神来，伸手猛的在自己的脸上拍了几下。“齐琳，你怕个毛线啊。”暗自骂了自己一声后，齐琳抬起脚快速的穿过草丛，细细的寻找着刚刚的声源。可是走了三十多米还是没有找到人影，齐琳正怀疑自己是听错了，却忽然看见前方草丛中的血迹，齐琳跑过去一看，一匹狼正躺在血泊中，齐琳蹲下身子伸手摸了摸“血还是热的，那么说，刚刚听到的是真的了。”忽然，脖颈间传来异常的冰冷，齐琳反射性的回头，却被一股重力狠狠的压在了地上，她的脸刚好被压在那匹狼的身上，狼血染得她半边脸都红了。“别动。”一个沙哑有力的男生传入耳朵，齐琳一怔。是人！！！齐琳放弃挣扎，却也感觉到一股热流从自己的颈间滑落。她知道，这个人···受伤了。见齐琳没有挣扎，男子微微一愣，就算是俎上鱼，都要垂死挣扎几下才行，但是手下这个人，完全没有要抵抗的意思。想到这里，男子稍微放松了力道，但是齐琳任然没有挣扎，就像是失去了意识一样。男子微微皱眉，诈死么？“我说···。”见压在自己身上的人正在试探自己，齐琳也不再噤声。可是她才一开口，头上的那只手的力道就更加的重，让她的脸几乎完全浸泡在血泊中。她几乎感觉得到小白愤怒的眸子了，但是碍于她没有发出暗示，小白正在努力的压抑心中的怒火，齐琳知道，要是她再不脱身，这个人恐怕要成为小白的腹中餐了。“你打算压到什么时候？不知道你很重的么？”男子微微一愣，这才意识到齐琳不会武功，只是一个普通人而已，便也松开了手，一下子跳开两米，静静的看着齐琳。齐琳从狼身上爬起来，这已经是第二次这么近距离的碰到狼尸体了。真是不吉利，随意的擦了擦脸上的血，脖子再一次被冰冷的利器碰到，齐琳也不惊慌。“你··阁下可是与我有深仇大恨？”齐琳本来想说你他妈和我有深仇大恨吗？可是话才到口中就被硬生生的换了个文雅的说法，虽然齐琳依旧面不改色，但是内心已经向上帝求救几百回了。可是很久都没有得到对方的回答，齐琳有些好奇，难道说这个人站着失去了意识？齐琳稍微动了动脖子“别动。”男子再次开口，吓得齐琳立刻僵直了身子。再也不敢动半分。感觉到身后的人正在做什么事情，齐琳也努力的想着法子脱身。忽然闻到一股火药味，便听见咻的一声，有什么东西飞上天空了。“嘭”一朵红色的烟火在空中爆发，同时也在齐琳的心中掀起了千层浪。过不久就会有很多人过来吧，不行，不能拖到那时候，齐琳握紧拳头，刚想要冲出男子的控制，便听见身后倒地的声音。齐琳好奇的回头，却看见一个身穿夜行衣的蒙面男子满身是血的倒在地上。齐琳不敢向前，只是保持着距离仔细的看着这个男子。“嗷呜”小白一下子从旁边的草丛冲出来，张开嘴巴就要咬断男子的脖子“等一下，小白。”齐琳连忙喝止，跑到男子的面前，她已经听到了由远及近的脚步声，不是一个，而是一群，这样下去不妙。可是···没有办法丢下这个人离去，好歹也是人，带走再说。“小白，拜托了。”齐琳将手上的男子扶上小白的背，再吩咐其他的狼将地上的狼尸体带走，朝着另一个方向离去，这样的话可以掩饰血迹了，再将这里弄得很乱，撕下男子身上的一块布，挂在树枝上，这才叫小白离开。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/meirenzhiqibutianxia/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 1 Seeing Humans for the First Time After the baptism of heavy rain, the entire forest looked much fresher, and the air was filled with the clarity of the earth. Qi Lin didn't care, she just stretched out her hand and gently patted the rain-covered shoulder. At this time, Qi Lin was no longer the Qi Lin wearing a tattered uniform. Half a year after Qi Lin came here, she had completely integrated into the life of this pack of wolves. Using her intelligence, she successfully defeated other wolves that came to compete for territory and drove away other beasts, and thus gained the recognition of the wolves. The snow wolf gave the skin to Qi Lin. It was snow-white and the skin of an adult wolf. It must have been hunted by someone, the skin was pulled out, and finally taken back. Qi Lin was very surprised that the snow wolf would give such a precious wolf skin to her, and it seemed that the snow wolf valued the skin very much, so he protected it so well. But giving it to a strange human in such a hurry cannot be justified. But after a month, Qi Lin finally figured it out. This piece of wolf skin is probably one of Snow Wolf's companions. Snow Wolf gave it to him as clothing, probably to let himself take the place of his companion. Is it a kind of giving up? So Qi Lin accepted the gift without hesitation, and made simple clothing from the animal skins, a tube top, a miniskirt, two wristbands, a pair of straw sandals made from grass vines, and padded with the remaining wolf skins, thus becoming a girl version of Taishan. She will not betray the trust that Snow Wolf has placed in her, so she will familiarize herself with this unfamiliar environment as soon as possible. \"Ouch~~\" Snow Wolf walked to Qi Lin's side and nuzzled, his sapphire blue eyes were full of tenderness. \"Xiao Bai, everyone has almost eaten and drank enough today.\" Qi Lin looked at the wolves who were resting. They went out to hunt today, and there was not much food in the cave. It was time to take some back. Moreover, it was already late autumn, and the wild fruits were getting really ripe. She could just pick some back. Qi Lin packed up the wild fruits she picked and shouted to the wolves, \"Everyone, let's go back... uh...\" \"Ouch~~\" Before Qi Lin could finish her words, she was interrupted by a strong murderous aura. The wolves were also infected by this murderous aura. They all formed a circle with Qi Lin as the center and looked around vigilantly. The originally relaxed atmosphere suddenly became a lot more tense. Qi Lin knew that because winter was coming, food would become scarce, so there were often scenes of wolves snatching food. However, every time Qi Lin goes out to look for food, she will make a tight plan and try to avoid other wolves. Today, she specially led the wolves to the northern part of the jungle. The temperature here is lower. Under normal circumstances, there will be no other wolves. Although the food will be relatively small, it is enough for their own wolf pack. But I didn't expect to meet other wolves here. Qi Lin packed the fruits with the animal skins she had prepared before, tied them behind her and jumped on the snow wolf's back. \"Amo, you take Xiaoman Xiaoyue and the others back with food first. On the first and fifteenth day of the lunar month, you guys come with me and Xiaobai.\" After hearing Qi Lin's instructions, the wolves carried out the order in an orderly manner. The wolves were divided into two teams, one pair ran towards the east of the jungle, and the other pair followed Qi Lin in the opposite direction. \"Xiao Bai, if you meet your opponent later, don't be too eager to fight. We are just distracting the other wolves so that Xiao Man and the others can go back smoothly. Do you understand?\" Qi Lin gave serious instructions in Xiao Bai's ear again, but found that Xiao Bai's speed slowed down and finally stopped. Qi Lin was puzzled, \"Xiao Bai?\" The other wolves also stopped with Xiao Bai, but they stared ahead without relaxing, but they stopped taking half a step forward. Qi Lin looked at the wolves strangely, and then looked around. Could it be that there was something more dangerous ahead? Qi Lin did not dare to jump off Xiao Bai's back without permission, so she could only observe her surroundings quietly. The atmosphere is as oppressive as before, and you can still vaguely hear the howls of wolves. They are the howls of a battle. Could it be that it is a battle between wolves? However, there are very few wolves in the north, and almost all of them go to the south to escape the cold and look for food. Qi Lin pricked up her ears and listened carefully to the movements in front of her, and her eyes carefully observed the movements of her wolf pack. She found that except for Xiaobai, the other wolves were acting very uneasy. Qi Lin grasped Xiaobai's neck hair, and her intuition told her that there was a fight going on ahead, and she could even smell the smell of blood in the air. Although she has lived with the wolves for half a year, Qi Lin only taught the wolves how to fight and did not personally participate in the battle. Now that she encountered them, she was inevitably a little trembling. He couldn't help but hold on to Xiaobai tightly, staring ahead with his lips turning white. Xiaobai seemed to sense Qi Lin's fear, turning his head and blinking at Qi Lin. Suddenly feeling something rushing over, he jumped a few meters away, staring intently at the grass that was emitting fire. The other wolves were also on high alert, and would tear it apart as soon as the thing rushed out. Qi Lin was also startled, her feet tightened against Xiao Bai's, her eyes widened. The sound of \"swish swish\" was getting closer and closer, but it was very chaotic, as if it was being chased by something. \"Ah\" \"Ouch\" Uh... Qi Lin felt that all the cells in her body were alive. This was not nervousness, but excitement. She just heard the screams of humans and the whimpers of wolves. Although she didn't know what happened, Qi Lin assured that she indeed heard human voices. And this person is not far away and should be approaching them. Qi Lin jumped off Xiao Bai and walked a few steps forward excitedly. She suddenly stopped again, turned to Xiao Bai, and said, \"Xiao Bai, you hide first. Don't come out without my instructions, okay?\" Xiao Bai tilted her head and looked at Qi Lin. Although she didn't know what Qi Lin planned to do, she still hid in the grass obediently. Qi Lin nodded gratefully, moved her gaze to the tall grass, raised her feet and wanted to walk over, but found that her feet seemed to be filled with lead.", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}